   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Window Views of Nearby Facades</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Window Views of Nearby Facades\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication with the original photographs: twenty close-up window views of the facade of a nearby building in residential neighbourhoods of Ljubljana, Slovenia, each covering two floors of the opposite building at about the same distance, photographed on one cloudy day in May 2021 from different architectural periods, with different elements and upkeep; the views deliberately leave out elements usually seen as good for visual comfort, and on five of the facades the authors added vegetation in Adobe Photoshop. Participants imagine that this is the view from their window and, for each of the twenty views, choose the paper's reaction to the view (11 options: frightening, scary, dangerous; incomprehensible, unpleasant; very disturbing, repellent, depressing; boring; soothing, pleasant; understandable, coherent, legible; attractive, fascinating, invigorating; dreamy, romantic; mysterious; acceptable, unobtrusive; does not evoke a determined response, neutral) and the reason that triggered it (7 options: surface characteristic, composition quality, narrative quality, complexity, dynamics, unpleasant/pleasant space, other). Gender, age and the type of settlement they live in are asked first. Rebuilt from Drobne, Zbašnik-Senegačnik, Kristl, Koprivec & Fikfak (2022), Analysis of the Window Views of the Nearby Façades, Sustainability 14(1): 269, with the photographs cropped from its Figure 2 and the reactions and reasons from its Table 1 (CC BY 4.0). Image ids: W01-W20 = window views 1-20; answers are in reaction (x1-x11) and reason (y1-y7), keyed by view. Analysis as in the paper: per view, the share of negative reactions (x1-x4), the most, second and third most frequent reaction and reason, the coefficient of variation of the reactions and F-tests of the homogeneity of the reaction and reason groups; the paper (98 third-year architecture students in Ljubljana) found negative reactions predominant for 12 of the 20 views, boring the most frequent reaction for many plain facades, more agreement on pleasant, attractive and acceptable views than on unpleasant ones, views with an interesting composition or greenery rated quite positively, and surface characteristics the main reason for negative reactions. Differences from the original study: (1) the paper's 52-question Moodle survey for one class of architecture students also asked about the institution where respondents live, their green spaces and contact with nature, whose wording is not printed, so only gender, age and settlement type are asked, in our wording; here anyone can take part; (2) the question wording, the instruction text and the view order (1 to 20, as numbered in the paper) are ours; (3) the photographs are the figure copies (about 400 x 270 px; the originals were resized to 480 x 320 px).\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"views\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"title\": \"Age (years)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"min\": 16,\n      \"max\": 100\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"settlement\",\n      \"title\": \"What type of settlement do you live in?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"city\",\n        \"text\": \"City\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"town\",\n        \"text\": \"Town\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"suburb\",\n        \"text\": \"Suburb\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"village\",\n        \"text\": \"Village or countryside\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"views\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"reaction\",\n      \"title\": \"How does this window view make you feel?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"x1\",\n        \"text\": \"frightening, scary, dangerous\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"x2\",\n        \"text\": \"incomprehensible, unpleasant\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"x3\",\n        \"text\": \"very disturbing, repellent, depressing\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"x4\",\n        \"text\": \"boring\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"x5\",\n        \"text\": \"soothing, pleasant\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"x6\",\n        \"text\": \"understandable, coherent, legible\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"x7\",\n        \"text\": \"attractive, fascinating, invigorating\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"x8\",\n        \"text\": \"dreamy, romantic\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"x9\",\n        \"text\": \"mysterious\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"x10\",\n        \"text\": \"acceptable, unobtrusive\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"x11\",\n        \"text\": \"does not evoke a determined response, neutral\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Keyed by view id (W01-W20).\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"reason\",\n      \"title\": \"What triggered this reaction?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"y1\",\n        \"text\": \"surface characteristic\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"y2\",\n        \"text\": \"composition quality\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"y3\",\n        \"text\": \"narrative quality\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"y4\",\n        \"text\": \"complexity\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"y5\",\n        \"text\": \"dynamics\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"y6\",\n        \"text\": \"unpleasant/pleasant space\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"y7\",\n        \"text\": \"other (can't define)\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Keyed by view id.\"\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"wv-original\">{\"source\": \"Drobne et al. (2022) Sustainability 14: 269\", \"n\": 98, \"negative_reactions\": [\"x1\", \"x2\", \"x3\", \"x4\"], \"share_negative\": {\"W01\": 90.8, \"W02\": 14.3, \"W03\": 88.8, \"W04\": 48.0, \"W05\": 69.4, \"W06\": 31.6, \"W07\": 26.5, \"W08\": 88.8, \"W09\": 87.8, \"W10\": 45.9, \"W11\": 73.5, \"W12\": 71.4, \"W13\": 25.5, \"W14\": 72.4, \"W15\": 65.3, \"W16\": 62.2, \"W17\": 33.7, \"W18\": 69.4, \"W19\": 43.9, \"W20\": 89.8}}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f0f1f4;--card:#fff;--ink:#1c1f26;--muted:#5b616d;--accent:#3a4f7a;--line:#d7dbe3;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#e1e7f3}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:14px}\n.b{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px}\n.b img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:8px}\n.b .no{font-weight:700;margin:6px 0 4px}\n.o{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:3px}\n.o label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:5px 1px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.68rem;line-height:1.15;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}\n.o label b{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink)}\n.o label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--ink)}\n.o input{display:none}\n.b.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:2px}\n.blk{margin-top:14px}.blk:first-child{margin-top:0}\n.blk.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:4px;border-radius:8px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\nlabel.opt:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.vis{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto}.vis img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:8px;background:#7f7f7f}\n.st{margin-top:12px}.st p{margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\n.adj{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:6px}\ninput.tx{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;width:100%;min-width:0}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:10px}\n@media (max-width:520px){.adj{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}.two .blk{margin-top:0}@media (max-width:700px){.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\nlabel.opt{padding:6px 10px;margin-top:4px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photographs, reactions and reasons: Drobne, Zbašnik-Senegačnik, Kristl, Koprivec &amp; Fikfak (2022), Sustainability 14(1): 269, Figure 2 and Table 1 (doi:10.3390/su14010269, CC BY 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='window-facades:state', N=20, IDS=[], BG=['gender','age','settlement'], QS=['reaction','reason'];\n  for(var i=1;i<=N;i++)IDS.push('W'+(i<10?'0':'')+i);\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Window views of nearby facades</h1><p>You will see twenty photographs of the facade of a building across the street. Imagine that this is what you see from your window. For each view, choose the reaction that best describes how it makes you feel and what triggered that reaction. First, three questions about you. It takes about 10 minutes.</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='about';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function about(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\">'+BG.map(function(n){var q=Q[n];\n      if(q.type==='text')return '<div class=\"blk\" data-n=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b><div><input class=\"tx\" type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" style=\"width:9em;margin-top:6px\" id=\"in_'+n+'\"></div></div>';\n      return '<div class=\"blk\" data-n=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b>'+(q.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}).join('')+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Continue</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var L=[],miss=[];\n      BG.forEach(function(n){var q=Q[n],blk=app.querySelector('.blk[data-n=\"'+n+'\"]');\n        if(q.type==='text'){var raw=(document.getElementById('in_'+n)||{}).value||'',v=Number(raw);if(raw&&v>=(q.min||0)&&v<=(q.max||120))L.push(SPSite.answer(n,v));else miss.push(blk);return;}\n        var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');if(x)L.push(SPSite.answer(n,x.value));else miss.push(blk);});\n      if(miss.length){miss.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('miss');});return err('Please answer all three questions (age as a number from 16 to 100).');}\n      send(L,this,function(){st.step='view';st.i=0;save();route();});};\n  }\n  function view(){\n    var k=st.i,id=IDS[k];\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>Window view '+(k+1)+' of '+N+'</h2><div class=\"vis\"><img alt=\"Window view '+(k+1)+': facade of the building opposite\" src=\"'+esc(files[id].url)+'\"></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"two\">'+QS.map(function(n){var q=Q[n];return '<div class=\"blk\" data-n=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b>'+(q.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}).join('')+'</div>'+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+(k<N-1?'Next view':'Finish')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var L=[],miss=[],o={key:id,shown:[files[id].name]};\n      QS.forEach(function(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');if(x)L.push(SPSite.answer(n,x.value,o));else miss.push(app.querySelector('.blk[data-n=\"'+n+'\"]'));});\n      if(miss.length){miss.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('miss');});miss[0].scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return err('Please choose a reaction and a reason.');}\n      send(L,this,function(){if(k<N-1)st.i=k+1;else st.step='done';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  function clr(e){var r=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('.blk');if(r){r.classList.remove('miss');if(!app.querySelector('.miss'))err('');}}\n  app.addEventListener('input',clr);app.addEventListener('change',clr);\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='about')return about();if(s==='view')return view();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){if(!SPSite.__nm){SPSite.__nm=1;var _gm=SPSite.getMedia;SPSite.getMedia=function(){var r=_gm.apply(SPSite,arguments),fx=function(m){if(!m||!m.name)return m;var c={},k;for(k in m)c[k]=m[k];c.name=String(m.name).replace(/__[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}(\\.[A-Za-z0-9]+)$/i,'$1');return c;};if(Array.isArray(r))return r.map(fx);if(r&&typeof r==='object'){var o={},k;for(k in r)o[k]=(r[k]||[]).map(fx);return o;}return r;};}(SPSite.getQuestions()||[]).forEach(function(q){if(q.type==='number'){q.type='text';q.inputType='number';}if(q.isRequired==null)q.isRequired=!!q.required;});\n    ['consent'].concat(BG,QS).forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('views')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=IDS.filter(function(k){return !files[k];});\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+esc(need.join(', '))+' (.jpg) to the media folder \"views\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.step)||a.consent!==true)st={step:'intro'};\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
